#############################################
# episodes-tgs-26-50.ttl -- batch #2, 2026-09-12.
# TGS interview episodes numbered 26 through 50.
#
# 14 of 25 numbers already built; 11 real, confirmed gaps minted as
# genuine minimal stubs. Two stubs (TGS-30 Steve Keen, TGS-45 Jon
# Erickson) link directly to real, already-existing Personas from a
# prior panel appearance (RR-3) rather than left as bare, disconnected
# placeholders -- caught mid-batch and retroactively applied to
# TGS-16's own stub from the PRIOR batch too (Tristan Harris), which
# had missed the same real, existing Persona link.
#
# tgs:Series.BendNotBreak is NOT re-declared here, even though TGS-31,
# 42, and 50 (all in this range) are real members -- it already lives
# in episodes-tgs-1-25.ttl, and duplicating the same individual across
# batch files would be redundant. Resolves naturally once batches
# accumulate into one file.
#
# Sorted by episode number. episodes.ttl itself is left untouched.
#############################################

